OL,3,GNEWSANew recycling centre 'will not
OL,4,Aincrease traffic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #6m household waste recycling
OL,7,Fcentre (HWRC) will be "accessible to
OL,8,Fmore people" and not increase traffic,
OL,9,Fa council's environment boss has said.
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council wants to
OL,12,Fbuild a modern HWRC next to the
OL,13,FBicester Park and Ride site by 2030, in
OL,14,Fthe process replacing a 40-year-old
OL,15,Ffacility at Ardley.
OL,17,FLaura Gordon, the authority's cabinet
OL,18,Fmember for environment and economy,
OL,19,Ftold the BBC: "Essentially it would
OL,20,Freroute traffic rather than increasing
OL,21,Fit is our belief."
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
