OL,3,GNEWSANew recycling centre 'will not
OL,4,Aincrease traffic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said "detailed traffic and
OL,7,Fqueue capacity and road-safety impacts
OL,8,Fon the surrounding highway network"
OL,9,Fwould be fully assessed as part of the
OL,10,Fplanning application.
